  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=INPUT:\nStory/Bug ID: {{ $json.storyId }}\nTitle: {{ $json.description }}\nDescription: {{ $json.description }}\nType: {{ $json.type }}\nVersion: {{ $json.version }}\nAssignee: {{ $json.assignee }}\n\n---\n\nGenerate 10–15 high-quality test cases using:\n- Positive\n- Negative\n- Boundary Value Analysis (BVA)\n- Equivalence Partitioning (EP)\n- Decision Table (if applicable)\n\nEach test case MUST include:\n\n- storyId (same as input)\n- title (clear test case title)\n- preconditions (what should exist before execution)\n- steps (numbered)\n- testData (input values used in test)\n- expected_result (expected outcome)\n- technique (Positive / Negative / BVA / EP / Decision Table)\n- assigned_to (same as input assignee)\n\nMake sure:\n- No field is left empty\n- Provide meaningful realistic content\n- Steps should be clearly numbered\n\n---\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON array. No explanation.\n\nFORMAT:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"storyId\": \"\",\n    \"title\": \"\",\n    \"description\": \"\",\n    \"preconditions\": \"\",\n    \"steps\": \"\",\n    \"testData\": {},\n    \"expected_result\": \"\",\n    \"technique\": \"\",\n    \"assigned_to\": \"\"\n  }\n]",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a Senior QA Automation Assistant integrated with Excel and Jira. Your job is to generate comprehensive test cases that can be directly stored in Excel and created in Jira, linked to the same Story/Bug. Use structured QA testing techniques to ensure full functional coverage including edge cases and realistic business scenarios. ALL test cases must use the SAME StoryID and SAME Assignee provided in the input."
        }
      },
